{"newProfiles":[],"profileAdditions":[{"role":"typescript-engineer","rules":["Use CommonJS module syntax: export with `module.exports` or `export =`, not ES `export default`. The project has no `\"type\": \"module\"` in package.json, so ES module syntax will fail at runtime.","When running TypeScript tests with tsx, use `npx tsx --test src/hello.test.ts` — the project uses Node's built-in test runner (`node:test`), not Jest or Vitest, so do not import from `@jest/globals` or `vitest`.","Do not add `import.meta.url` or top-level `await` — these are ESM-only constructs that will cause syntax errors in a CommonJS project.","Do not modify package.json, tsconfig.json, or any scaffold-phase infrastructure file. If a change seems needed (e.g., adding a script or dependency), flag it as a blocker instead of making the edit."]}],"storyRoleAssignments":[{"agentRole":"typescript-engineer","storyId":"MOCK-HW-1"}]}
